            <ArticleTitle>Neuropathic Pain Management: A Reference for the Clinical Nurse.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>381-9, 438</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The International Association for the Study of Pain neuropathic pain guidelines are presented. Nursing considerations, including neuropathic pain assessment and medication efficacy, are reported to explain medications' primary mechanisms of action and provide a nursing reference for patient education.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
